for creating react component automatically: 

functional component : rfc(react functional component)/rfac (react funcitonal arrow component)
class component: rcc+tab(react class component+tab key)/ rcc (react class component)

rafc : 

import React from 'react'

export const Scooty = () => {
  return (
    <div>Scooty</div>
  )
}

rfc:

import React from 'react'

export default function Scooty() {
  return (
    <div>Scooty</div>
  )
}

